ds important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "factor", "type": "name"}, {"content": "reason; explanation", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  The price of the stamp is based on two factors.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about the price of stamps.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to depend", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to change according to something else", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  The value of a stamp depends on supply and demand.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "supply", "type": "name"}, {"content": "how much of a product or service is available", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: A stamp is usually valuable if it exists in  limited supply.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "demand", "type": "name"}, {"content": "how many people want to obtain a product or service", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  A stamp is also valuable if there is a large demand for it. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "category", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a group of objects or parts that are divided according to what they have in common", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There are three types of stamp categories: mint, unused, and used.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "glue", "type": "name"}, {"content": "adhesive product used to stick one thing to another", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Other factors also affect the value of a stamp, such as the type of glue.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "collector", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who likes to collect an item", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Some stamps are sometimes worth up to a million dollars to a collector.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob10aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Adverbs of Frequency", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Adverbs of frequency (always, usually, never, etc.) say how often something happens.<br><br>Sometimes the adverb specifies the exact frequency of the action, like <span class=\"italic\"> yearly</span> or <span class=\"italic\"> daily</span>. These are called definite adverbs of frequency.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Indefinite adverbs of frequency are usually placed before the verb.<br/> e.g. <span class=\"italic\">I often walk home from work.</span><br/><br/> With verb tenses that have two parts, or when an auxiliary is used, the adverb is placed between the auxiliary and the main verb.<br/> e.g. <span class=\"italic\">I can rarely eat chocolate.</span> <br/><br/>  Definite adverbs of frequency are usually placed after the main verb or direct object if there is one.<br/> e.g. <span class=\"italic\">We go to the stamp convention yearly.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":11,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adverb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"How Often?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"always\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"100%\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"often\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"80%\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"usually\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"60%\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"rarely\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"10%\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"never\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"0%\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"daily\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"once a day\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"weekly\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"once a week\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"biweekly\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"once every two weeks\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"monthly\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"once a month\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"yearly\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"once a year\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Why is it that some stamps are sometimes worth a few cents while others are worth up to a million dollars? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Used stamps often have a cancellation mark because they have been mailed on a letter.  ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Adverbs of Manner", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use adverbs of manner to describe how something is done.<br/><br/>Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">You look carefully at them!</span><br>How do you look? Carefully.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Many adverbs are formed by adding <span class=\"italic\">-ly</span> to an adjective. When the adjective ends in <span class=\"strong\">y</span>, you take out the letter and add <span class=\"italic\">\u2013ily</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/> slow \u2013 slowly<br/> happy \u2013 happily ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The adjectives <span class=\"italic\">fast</span>, <span class=\"italic\">hard</span>, <span class=\"italic\">well </span>and <span class=\"italic\">straight</span> are exceptions.  They do not change when they become adverbs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Some adverbs, like <span class=\"italic\">basically</span> or <span class=\"italic\">generally</span>, are often placed at the beginning of the sentence.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adverb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"direct<br> obvious<br>\\t enthusiastic<br> definite<br>\\t competitive<br>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"directly<br> obviously<br> enthusiastically <br>definitely<br> competitively\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "The price of the stamp depends directly on two factors: demand and condition.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Obviously, mint stamps are the most valuable.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Not all the words that end in <span class=\"strong\">ly</span> are adverb. <br/><br/> For example: <br>Supply, is a verb and also a noun.<br> Holy, is an adjective.<br> Friendly  and lovely are adjectives, too.<br> Dragonfly, is a noun. Apply, is a verb.", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Think of things other than stamps that people collect.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Do research on 2 different collections. Read articles or watch videos online.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Complete the table with the information you found.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Present your results to a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":5,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Collection:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">What is the price range for items?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">What affects the price?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">How do you contact the collectors?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Where do they get the items?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <br><br>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <br><br>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <br><br>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <br><br>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <br><br>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <br><br>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <br><br>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <br><br>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <br><br>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <br><br>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I research 2 different collections.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I complete the table.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I present the results of the research.", "type": "text"}]}]}